{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786928036697806001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"illegible-principal-grayfox","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"dd224930ffb7073742f987ece57509640c124b1ffe651f4648b943d24019192c","event_uuid":"f1ba11b8-2d49-4cee-a771-5e22557eb54e","position":{"commit_sha":"c56328a4aee3c4e67dfae3b8d1fd3554abab8203","position":"1786925673924915001-f1ba11b8-2d49-4cee-a771-5e22557eb54e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"cb6b9cadd54eca98090e0869b9cac001842af2ed1af87640f907a1dd505526cc","event_uuid":"ded95f55-1643-489a-a85e-cbe3d9f6a8a7","position":{"commit_sha":"20506b13bcf96b4200e20e3654c43071c763cf8b","position":"1786925682680632001-ded95f55-1643-489a-a85e-cbe3d9f6a8a7"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786925673924915001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"ded95f55-1643-489a-a85e-cbe3d9f6a8a7","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"e06a-1450-5e1b-42fc"}],"description":"## Context\nA clean local `rebar review-code` run emitted repeated `rebar.llm.structured` warnings: `parse_structured: multiple candidates validated ...; selecting the LAST`. For `CodeReviewBaseOutput`, `CodeReviewFindings`, and `VerificationOutput`, the logged first and last candidates were semantically identical, so the run passed but incurred ambiguous parsing and duplicate output/token cost. A tracker search found only closed historical tickets (`exultant-neofascist-bluegill`, `floaty-precious-rodent`) and no open bug owning the live warning. Discovered while verifying `treelike-unamusing-grosbeak`.\n\n## Reproduction\nRun an enabled local `rebar review-code` over a small committed diff with the configured Bedrock/Pydantic-AI runner and capture `rebar.llm.structured` warnings. The observed run emitted the warning for three output schemas while returning PASS.\n\n## Plan\nUse `rebar-debug` to prove whether duplication originates in model text, native structured-output envelopes, retry aggregation, or candidate extraction. Coordinate with RP-01 research (`sandstone-fiendish-auk`) before implementation; do not preempt that session’s structured-output design decisions. If changing candidate-selection semantics or provider behavior is required, return an evidence-backed decision brief for approval.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The duplicate-candidate mechanism is reproduced and proven at runtime with raw response boundaries captured safely.\n- [ ] Existing closed structured-output work and active RP-01 research are checked for overlap/dependency.\n- [ ] Identical duplicates are distinguished from conflicting valid candidates.\n- [ ] The warning is eliminated without weakening ambiguous-output detection or changing selection semantics without approval.\n- [ ] Focused structured-output and review gates pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["warning","llm","structured-output"],"ticket_id":"d74a-6a76-c846-4710","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Structured LLM replies emit duplicate valid payload candidates","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f1ba11b8-2d49-4cee-a771-5e22557eb54e","ded95f55-1643-489a-a85e-cbe3d9f6a8a7"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786928036697806001,"uuid":"ef5b16a8-b312-445d-9132-d906dbb54bcf"}